{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_07",
  "title": "Betrayal",
  "storyCode": "MB-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "629eb28636879ebb951cbe00d607e9c88328a37517895c61200ec007a825145f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Urgh, god dammit, where in the world did my card key go...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Did I flush it while taking a dump?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Chief Barton, what's wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Mind your own business!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Y-Yes, sir!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Tsk, stuck-up asshole...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "text": "I'm guessing... someone probably pissed him off.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Heh, probably Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "I don't really know what's going on, but it seems like someone's trying to kill him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Barton likes to brag about how perfect the prison is. This is gonna keep him on tenterhooks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "text": "We're prison guards, you know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Eh, it's not someone getting killed that I'm happy about. I just like seeing him so peeved.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Besides, let's be honest. We've seen Randal and Barton do so much dirty work over the years.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "If you ask me, I think Randal knows who sent these hitmen in here. He's just turning a blind eye because he's in their pocket.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer B",
      "text": "Maybe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Gah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Don't move, Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Don't make me kill you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Well, damn, Robin. You're good. Even I didn't have you pegged for a spy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "I think you just might have a gift for this gig.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Wait a minute. What are you holding?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Whoa, that a bomb switch?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Kafka, lower the tower right now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Whoa! It's burning!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Hurry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "I forgot which one's which!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "And I kinda get the feeling these probably aren't gonna work anymore!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Oh, there we go! Should be this one!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Please! Please work!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "There!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "It's not moving! Is the thing broken?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Robin, why are you doing this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "It's going down!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Dagnabbit!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Whatever, I don't even remember when was the last time I was up there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Just need to have Randal make me a new one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "Tsk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "Chief Barton, you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "What are you doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "I'm heading upstairs to see how those damned fools are doing with the clean-up work!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jailer A",
      "text": "What... What happened here?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Barton",
      "text": "What in the name of... What's going on here?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Hold onto something, Kafka!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Anthony, over there! Robin's gonna get thrown into the elevator!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Hold on tight, Robin!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Why...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Save it for later!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Get ready!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Anthony, you and Robin okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I'm fine. I got Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Seems like the whole prison's power went out. It's pitch dark here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "This is an opportunity for us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "It feels like the tower crashed straight through the floor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "We're probably at the second floor basement. Still some distance away from the clinic.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Right, we should get going before the jailers get here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Robin, are you okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I-Is it really a good thing that I'm okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "It is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Don't let it get to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I did tell you before you could keep trying to kill me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "If you think you betrayed me for what you did, let me tell you this—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I'm afraid none of us are close enough to talk about trust just yet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Heh, not even me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Not even you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kafka",
      "text": "Oh, come on, that's cold.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Wouldn't you say it's more problematic to completely trust a person after just a few months?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Of course, I am a little disappointed, but that's all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Nonetheless, I'm curious. I can tell you weren't acting when we were working together. You can't fake those emotions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Why did you do this, Robin?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "My father. He made lots of money, and he was nice to me. I'm proud of him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "But one day, his company went bankrupt.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "And he's been a failure ever since.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "So he changed. He started drinking a lot, and he got angry. He hated everything around him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "My mother left him. He was heavily in debt, and in the end, went into the hospital with liver problems, and so many other complications I don't even get the details of.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "My mother tried to talk me into moving in with her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "But I never forgot how well my father used to treat me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I wanted to do something for him. So I gave up my hobbies. I tried taking on all kinds of jobs, but the medical bills kept coming.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "Then, one day, someone came to me. He said he could give me lots of money. I just had to kill someone for him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "And I'm the target.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I see. I can't offer you anything, and that's why you made this choice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "No, he's been watching you here, dressed as a jailer. His name is Jesselton.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "After you made me the offer, he found me and told me—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "The very last thing that the Simons did was destroy my father's company.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "My goodness.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "In that case, not only should I not hold this against you, I must apologize.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "No, don't apologize. That isn't what I'm trying to say.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "It's not like that, Anthony.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I knew I was doin' wrong. I knew I shouldn't do it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "But I gave up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I didn't know what I was supposed to do, otherwise. I just didn't know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I'm tired. My mother wanted me to make a choice, my father wanted me to make a choice, life wanted me to make a choice, Jesselton wanted me to make a choice, and even you wanted me to make a choice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I don't wanna make any choices. I don't wanna judge what's right or what's wrong, good or bad. I just don't want to.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I'm sick of it! Why do I have to choose?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "But, you know, Robin, you can't just hand off your decisions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You have to think everything through and make your own choices. Then, you need to take responsibility for each of those choices.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Otherwise, you'll never be able to take your fate into your own hands.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "This is the most important thing I've learned during my years here in prison.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Strength is important, and so is intelligence, but the most important trait of all is courage. The courage to make your own decisions and pay the price for them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I'm afraid of making wrong decisions myself, but I can't let that get in the way of making decisions at all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I used to think I had no one to rely on because I hadn't found anyone reliable, but I've come to realize there is no one we can truly rely on anywhere in this world.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "No one but ourselves.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I'm sorry I didn't notice your pain in time, Robin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I must reiterate. What you've done almost ruined my escape plan. That's why I won't forgive you so easily.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Nonetheless, as someone who has suffered a similar situation, I hope you can forget about all this for the time being.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You must scrutinize yourself and think about what it is that you want to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "What it is... that I want to do...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "Domma's room is right up ahead. You have all the time you need to think.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "I understand if you don't completely trust me, but I told Jesselton everything about your plan. He's definitely waiting for you somewhere up ahead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Oh, you don't hafta worry about finding me. I've been waiting for you right here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Robin",
      "text": "It's coming from Domma's room!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anthony",
      "text": "You don't mean...?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
